DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:The Oath
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:through Jun 30\nSince the beginning of time — in community\, 
 clan\, congregation\, and club — humans have developed systems\, both ut
 opian and dystopian\, for moving together in unison in large groups. The O
 ath\, a film based on Annie-B Parson’s stage choreography\, explores hum
 anity’s dance of vernacular and poetic group actions. Set in a vivid uni
 verse of color\, the work spans time\, from the primeval age and into the 
 future\, and features seventeen women and femmes moving as one for purpose
  and for pleasure\, to gather\, to bond\, to intimidate\, to believe\, to 
 fight\, to promise – to dance.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/annie-b-parso
 n-and-alla-kovgan-big-dance-theater-the-oath/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/annie-b-parson-and-alla-kovgan-big-dance-the
 ater-the-oath/
END:VEVENT
